{
  "source": "Prompts/when-you-need-more-v6.mp4",
  "duration": 168.9813125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.14,
      "text": "For many tasks, you open your AI app, ask a question, and keep the conversation go out."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.8,
      "end": 7.78,
      "text": "But some tasks ask more of AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.34,
      "end": 13.28,
      "text": "You might need help working through a complicated plan, weighing options, or investigating information"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.28,
      "end": 18.72,
      "text": "across sources. Depending on the app and your subscription, you may have three other choices"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.72,
      "end": 24.58,
      "text": "for these demanding tasks. The model, thinking, and research. You won't need to change them every"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.58,
      "end": 29.9,
      "text": "time. But knowing what they do helps you get a significantly better answer. When you use an"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.9,
      "end": 37.14,
      "text": "AI app, an LLM powers its answers. Think of it as the engine inside the app. Choosing a model"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.14,
      "end": 42.72,
      "text": "means choosing your engine. Different models have different capabilities. You start with the default,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.06,
      "end": 48.7,
      "text": "but can upgrade to a more capable one when needed. On the which model graphic, the everyday model"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.7,
      "end": 54.06,
      "text": "is for quick questions, like suggest a funny movie to watch tonight. The more capable model"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.06,
      "end": 59.68,
      "text": "handles demanding tasks. For example, help me plan a summer business, including costs, pricing,"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.1,
      "end": 65.52,
      "text": "and how many customers I'll need. Choosing a model changes your LLM. But thinking is a different"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.52,
      "end": 70.66,
      "text": "variable. It doesn't change the engine. It changes how much time the AI spends working through your"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.66,
      "end": 76.5,
      "text": "task. AI isn't thinking the way you do, but it spends more time working through the task"
    },
    {
      "start": 76.5,
      "end": 82.74,
      "text": "before giving you an answer. This next board asks, how much thinking? With less thinking,"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.74,
      "end": 88.92,
      "text": "AI spends less time working through your task. It is useful for less complicated and routine work."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.56,
      "end": 93.64,
      "text": "For example, ask, turn these notes from our group meeting into a clear checklist."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.88,
      "end": 99.26,
      "text": "With more thinking, AI spends more time working through steps, weighing options,"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.48,
      "end": 103.32,
      "text": "and checking its answer. It is useful for tasks that require analysis,"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.02,
      "end": 110.02,
      "text": "like coding, planning, and problems with steps. For example, ask, help us divide this project"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.02,
      "end": 115.06,
      "text": "among four people. We have one week, different schedules, and only two people know how to edit"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.06,
      "end": 121.76,
      "text": "video. There is one more option, research. This mode gathers information from different websites"
    },
    {
      "start": 121.76,
      "end": 126.74,
      "text": "and brings it together so you can compare your options. Regular chat can look things up on the"
    },
    {
      "start": 126.74,
      "end": 131.54,
      "text": "internet too, but research is designed for a fuller, comprehensive investigation across"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.54,
      "end": 137.36,
      "text": "several sources simultaneously. For a regular chat, I live in Dallas. How long would it take"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.36,
      "end": 143.22,
      "text": "me to drive to Texas A&M in college station versus UT Austin? Use deep research to get"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.22,
      "end": 147.58,
      "text": "information from many websites, compare what they say, and build a report that shows sources."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.34,
      "end": 153.74,
      "text": "For example, ask, I want to study physics, and I'm considering Texas A&M and UT Austin."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.26,
      "end": 158.4,
      "text": "Compare their physics programs, undergraduate research opportunities, admissions requirements,"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.04,
      "end": 165.74,
      "text": "and costs. Show your sources. Model, thinking, research. Use them when the work demands more."
    }
  ],
